{"post_stream": {"posts": [{"id": 295109, "name": "Lamy Geier", "username": "lamyer", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/l/b193c8/{size}.png", "created_at": "2024-04-22T22:52:25.161Z", "cooked": "<p>I did <code>sudo remove -y lua</code>, thinking that it would remove lua and related packages!</p>\n<p>It ended up deleting  4158 packages (including texlive , libre-office and several others in the displayed “unused dependency section”, which I am unable to recall).  While the destruction was going on, I got panicked and tried to cancel the operation by Ctrl + c, to no relief, I forced end the terminal.</p>\n<p>Now I did: <code>dnf history list</code>,  and it shows</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-plaintext\">ID     | Command line                                 | Date and time    | Action(s)      | Altered\n---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n   339 | remove -y lua                                | 2024-04-23 00:42 | Removed        | 4158 ##\n</code></pre>\n<ol>\n<li>How can get back everything to previous state?</li>\n<li>After getting the previous state, is it possible to just remove lua from <code>dnf</code>?</li>\n<li>How could one know what all other packages will be removed before removing the command? <code>dnf info lua</code> didn’t warn me of this!</li>\n</ol>", "post_number": 1, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 15, "updated_at": "2024-04-22T23:14:59.773Z", "reply_count": 2, "reply_to_post_number": null, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 5714, "reads": 64, "readers_count": 63, "score": 28587.8, "yours": false, "topic_id": 114000, "topic_slug": "unable-to-dnf-history-rollback-to-undo-remove-and-all-removed-unused-dependencies", "display_username": "Lamy Geier", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 2, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": null, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [{"id": 2, "count": 1}], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 14510, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 2, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/unable-to-dnf-history-rollback-to-undo-remove-and-all-removed-unused-dependencies/114000/1", "event": null, "calendar_details": [], "reactions": [{"id": "heart", "type": "emoji", "count": 1}], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 1, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": null}, {"id": 295112, "name": "hammerhead corvette", "username": "hamrheadcorvette", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/hamrheadcorvette/{size}/32965_2.png", "created_at": "2024-04-22T23:06:35.222Z", "cooked": "<p>Can you try : <code>sudo dnf history rollback 339</code> ?</p>", "post_number": 2, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 15, "updated_at": "2024-04-22T23:06:35.222Z", "reply_count": 2, "reply_to_post_number": null, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 8, "reads": 62, "readers_count": 61, "score": 77.4, "yours": false, "topic_id": 114000, "topic_slug": "unable-to-dnf-history-rollback-to-undo-remove-and-all-removed-unused-dependencies", "display_username": "hammerhead corvette", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": "", "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [{"id": 2, "count": 1}], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 977, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 4, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/unable-to-dnf-history-rollback-to-undo-remove-and-all-removed-unused-dependencies/114000/2", "event": null, "reactions": [{"id": "heart", "type": "emoji", "count": 1}], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 1, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": null}, {"id": 295113, "name": "Lamy Geier", "username": "lamyer", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/l/b193c8/{size}.png", "created_at": "2024-04-22T23:07:51.863Z", "cooked": "<p>I knew about this, but was not sure if it also reverts all other 4158 packages. Can you please confirm this?</p>", "post_number": 3, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 15, "updated_at": "2024-04-22T23:07:51.863Z", "reply_count": 1, "reply_to_post_number": 2, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 18, "reads": 61, "readers_count": 60, "score": 122.2, "yours": false, "topic_id": 114000, "topic_slug": "unable-to-dnf-history-rollback-to-undo-remove-and-all-removed-unused-dependencies", "display_username": "Lamy Geier", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": null, "reply_to_user": {"id": 977, "username": "hamrheadcorvette", "name": "hammerhead corvette", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/hamrheadcorvette/{size}/32965_2.png"}, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [{"id": 2, "count": 1}], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 14510, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 2, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/unable-to-dnf-history-rollback-to-undo-remove-and-all-removed-unused-dependencies/114000/3", "event": null, "reactions": [{"id": "bluethumb", "type": "emoji", "count": 1}], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 1, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": null}, {"id": 295114, "name": "hammerhead corvette", "username": "hamrheadcorvette", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/hamrheadcorvette/{size}/32965_2.png", "created_at": "2024-04-22T23:09:44.800Z", "cooked": "<p>Rolling back a transaction using <code>dnf history rollback</code> typically reverts all changes made by that specific transaction. In your case, ID 339 corresponds to the removal of lua and the subsequent removal of 4158 packages. Also, I did not include the <code>-y</code> so you should see it before it happens.</p>", "post_number": 4, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 15, "updated_at": "2024-04-22T23:09:44.800Z", "reply_count": 1, "reply_to_post_number": 3, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 21, "reads": 59, "readers_count": 58, "score": 136.8, "yours": false, "topic_id": 114000, "topic_slug": "unable-to-dnf-history-rollback-to-undo-remove-and-all-removed-unused-dependencies", "display_username": "hammerhead corvette", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": "", "reply_to_user": {"id": 14510, "username": "lamyer", "name": "Lamy Geier", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/l/b193c8/{size}.png"}, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [{"id": 2, "count": 1}], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 977, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 4, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/unable-to-dnf-history-rollback-to-undo-remove-and-all-removed-unused-dependencies/114000/4", "event": null, "reactions": [{"id": "heart", "type": "emoji", "count": 1}], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 1, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": null}, {"id": 295115, "name": "Lamy Geier", "username": "lamyer", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/l/b193c8/{size}.png", "created_at": "2024-04-22T23:11:27.870Z", "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"hamrheadcorvette\" data-post=\"2\" data-topic=\"114000\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://sea1.discourse-cdn.com/fedoraproject/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/hamrheadcorvette/48/32965_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> hammerhead corvette:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>sudo dnf history rollback 339</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-plaintext\">$ sudo dnf history rollback 339\nLast metadata expiration check: 2:27:57 ago on Mon 22 Apr 2024 22:42:49 CEST.\nDependencies resolved.\nNothing to do.\nComplete!\n</code></pre>\n<p>Nothing happened beyond the above message</p>", "post_number": 5, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 15, "updated_at": "2024-04-22T23:11:27.870Z", "reply_count": 1, "reply_to_post_number": 4, "quote_count": 1, "incoming_link_count": 27, "reads": 56, "readers_count": 55, "score": 151.2, "yours": false, "topic_id": 114000, "topic_slug": "unable-to-dnf-history-rollback-to-undo-remove-and-all-removed-unused-dependencies", "display_username": "Lamy Geier", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": null, "reply_to_user": {"id": 977, "username": "hamrheadcorvette", "name": "hammerhead corvette", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/hamrheadcorvette/{size}/32965_2.png"}, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 14510, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 2, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/unable-to-dnf-history-rollback-to-undo-remove-and-all-removed-unused-dependencies/114000/5", "event": null, "reactions": [], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 0, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": null}, {"id": 295117, "name": "hammerhead corvette", "username": "hamrheadcorvette", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/hamrheadcorvette/{size}/32965_2.png", "created_at": "2024-04-22T23:15:11.944Z", "cooked": "<p>You can verify the status of the transaction by running <code>sudo dnf history info 339</code>  to see if there are any error messages or additional information that might explain why the rollback didn’t work.</p>", "post_number": 6, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 15, "updated_at": "2024-04-22T23:15:11.944Z", "reply_count": 1, "reply_to_post_number": 5, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 32, "reads": 50, "readers_count": 49, "score": 190.0, "yours": false, "topic_id": 114000, "topic_slug": "unable-to-dnf-history-rollback-to-undo-remove-and-all-removed-unused-dependencies", "display_username": "hammerhead corvette", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": "", "reply_to_user": {"id": 14510, "username": "lamyer", "name": "Lamy Geier", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/l/b193c8/{size}.png"}, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [{"id": 2, "count": 1}], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 977, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 4, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/unable-to-dnf-history-rollback-to-undo-remove-and-all-removed-unused-dependencies/114000/6", "event": null, "reactions": [{"id": "heart", "type": "emoji", "count": 1}], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 1, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": null}, {"id": 295118, "name": "Lamy Geier", "username": "lamyer", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/l/b193c8/{size}.png", "created_at": "2024-04-22T23:16:55.122Z", "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"hamrheadcorvette\" data-post=\"6\" data-topic=\"114000\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://sea1.discourse-cdn.com/fedoraproject/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/hamrheadcorvette/48/32965_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> hammerhead corvette:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>sudo dnf history info 339</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Please see the output at: <a href=\"https://0x0.st/Xo72.txt\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://0x0.st/Xo72.txt</a></p>", "post_number": 7, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 15, "updated_at": "2024-04-22T23:16:55.122Z", "reply_count": 2, "reply_to_post_number": 6, "quote_count": 1, "incoming_link_count": 19, "reads": 49, "readers_count": 48, "score": 114.8, "yours": false, "topic_id": 114000, "topic_slug": "unable-to-dnf-history-rollback-to-undo-remove-and-all-removed-unused-dependencies", "display_username": "Lamy Geier", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "link_counts": [{"url": "https://0x0.st/Xo72.txt", "internal": false, "reflection": false, "clicks": 34}], "read": true, "user_title": null, "reply_to_user": {"id": 977, "username": "hamrheadcorvette", "name": "hammerhead corvette", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/hamrheadcorvette/{size}/32965_2.png"}, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 14510, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 2, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/unable-to-dnf-history-rollback-to-undo-remove-and-all-removed-unused-dependencies/114000/7", "event": null, "reactions": [], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 0, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": null}, {"id": 295122, "name": "hammerhead corvette", "username": "hamrheadcorvette", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/hamrheadcorvette/{size}/32965_2.png", "created_at": "2024-04-22T23:33:19.845Z", "cooked": "<blockquote>\n<p>Please see the output at: <a href=\"https://0x0.st/Xo72.txt\">https://0x0.st/Xo72.txt</a></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Well that sucks, You can take that info and make a script then reinstall all of the packages with a small bash script.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-plaintext\">\n#!/bin/bash\n\n# List of packages to reinstall (replace with the actual list from the transaction log)\npackages=(\n\n)\n\n# Reinstall packages\nfor pkg in \"${packages[@]}\"; do\n    sudo dnf install -y \"$pkg\"\ndone\n</code></pre>\n<p>Then save the file and make it executable.</p>\n<p><code>chmod +x reinstall_packages.sh</code></p>\n<p>I used vim to cleanup the file.</p>\n<p>like so :</p>\n<p>vim <code>:%s/^ \\*\\* //</code> &amp; then <code>:%s/ @@System$//</code></p>\n<p>I used the same for Removed <code>:%s/Removed //</code></p>", "post_number": 8, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 15, "updated_at": "2024-04-22T23:36:01.919Z", "reply_count": 0, "reply_to_post_number": 7, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 37, "reads": 48, "readers_count": 47, "score": 194.6, "yours": false, "topic_id": 114000, "topic_slug": "unable-to-dnf-history-rollback-to-undo-remove-and-all-removed-unused-dependencies", "display_username": "hammerhead corvette", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "link_counts": [{"url": "https://0x0.st/Xo72.txt", "internal": false, "reflection": false, "clicks": 13}], "read": true, "user_title": "", "reply_to_user": {"id": 14510, "username": "lamyer", "name": "Lamy Geier", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/l/b193c8/{size}.png"}, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 977, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 4, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/unable-to-dnf-history-rollback-to-undo-remove-and-all-removed-unused-dependencies/114000/8", "event": null, "reactions": [], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 0, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": null}, {"id": 295123, "name": "Vladislav Grigoryev", "username": "vgaetera", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/vgaetera/{size}/2552_2.png", "created_at": "2024-04-22T23:35:21.046Z", "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"lamyer\" data-post=\"1\" data-topic=\"114000\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/l/b193c8/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Lamy Geier:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>How can get back everything to previous state?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Try this way:</p>\n<pre data-code-wrap=\"bash\"><code class=\"lang-bash\">sudo dnf history undo 339\n</code></pre>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"lamyer\" data-post=\"1\" data-topic=\"114000\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/l/b193c8/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Lamy Geier:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>is it possible to just remove lua from <code>dnf</code>?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>This also removes packages that depend on it.</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"lamyer\" data-post=\"1\" data-topic=\"114000\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/l/b193c8/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Lamy Geier:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>How could one know what all other packages will be removed before removing the command?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Avoid using the <code>-y</code> option.</p>", "post_number": 9, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 15, "updated_at": "2024-04-23T00:06:02.788Z", "reply_count": 2, "reply_to_post_number": null, "quote_count": 1, "incoming_link_count": 104, "reads": 45, "readers_count": 44, "score": 584.0, "yours": false, "topic_id": 114000, "topic_slug": "unable-to-dnf-history-rollback-to-undo-remove-and-all-removed-unused-dependencies", "display_username": "Vladislav Grigoryev", "primary_group_name": "ask-fedora", "flair_name": "ask-fedora", "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": "", "flair_color": "", "flair_group_id": 53, "badges_granted": [], "version": 2, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": "", "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [{"id": 2, "count": 3}], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 549, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 3, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/unable-to-dnf-history-rollback-to-undo-remove-and-all-removed-unused-dependencies/114000/9", "event": null, "reactions": [{"id": "heart", "type": "emoji", "count": 2}, {"id": "totally", "type": "emoji", "count": 1}], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 3, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": null}, {"id": 295124, "name": "hammerhead corvette", "username": "hamrheadcorvette", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/hamrheadcorvette/{size}/32965_2.png", "created_at": "2024-04-22T23:36:21.560Z", "cooked": "<p>I think OP broke it when they did Ctrl+C</p>", "post_number": 10, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 15, "updated_at": "2024-04-22T23:36:21.560Z", "reply_count": 1, "reply_to_post_number": 9, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 10, "reads": 43, "readers_count": 42, "score": 63.6, "yours": false, "topic_id": 114000, "topic_slug": "unable-to-dnf-history-rollback-to-undo-remove-and-all-removed-unused-dependencies", "display_username": "hammerhead corvette", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": "", "reply_to_user": {"id": 549, "username": "vgaetera", "name": "Vladislav Grigoryev", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/vgaetera/{size}/2552_2.png"}, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 977, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 4, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/unable-to-dnf-history-rollback-to-undo-remove-and-all-removed-unused-dependencies/114000/10", "event": null, "reactions": [], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 0, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": null}, {"id": 295125, "name": "Vladislav Grigoryev", "username": "vgaetera", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/vgaetera/{size}/2552_2.png", "created_at": "2024-04-22T23:39:53.449Z", "cooked": "<p>DNF handles <code>history rollback</code> and <code>history undo</code> differently, see:<br>\n<a href=\"https://www.mankier.com/8/dnf#Commands-History_Command\" class=\"inline-onebox\">dnf: DNF Command Reference | dnf System Administration | Man Pages | ManKier</a></p>", "post_number": 11, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 15, "updated_at": "2024-04-22T23:40:21.786Z", "reply_count": 0, "reply_to_post_number": 10, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 3, "reads": 40, "readers_count": 39, "score": 68.0, "yours": false, "topic_id": 114000, "topic_slug": "unable-to-dnf-history-rollback-to-undo-remove-and-all-removed-unused-dependencies", "display_username": "Vladislav Grigoryev", "primary_group_name": "ask-fedora", "flair_name": "ask-fedora", "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": "", "flair_color": "", "flair_group_id": 53, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "link_counts": [{"url": "https://www.mankier.com/8/dnf#Commands-History_Command", "internal": false, "reflection": false, "title": "dnf: DNF Command Reference | dnf System Administration | Man Pages | ManKier", "clicks": 70}], "read": true, "user_title": "", "reply_to_user": {"id": 977, "username": "hamrheadcorvette", "name": "hammerhead corvette", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/hamrheadcorvette/{size}/32965_2.png"}, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [{"id": 2, "count": 3}], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 549, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 3, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/unable-to-dnf-history-rollback-to-undo-remove-and-all-removed-unused-dependencies/114000/11", "event": null, "reactions": [{"id": "heart", "type": "emoji", "count": 2}, {"id": "totally", "type": "emoji", "count": 1}], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 3, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": null}, {"id": 295128, "name": "Jeff V", "username": "computersavvy", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/computersavvy/{size}/4741_2.png", "created_at": "2024-04-23T00:02:50.335Z", "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"lamyer\" data-post=\"1\" data-topic=\"114000\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/l/b193c8/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Lamy Geier:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>How could one know what all other packages will be removed before removing the command?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Understanding system commands and how the package manger works is critical.<br>\nDnf <em>always</em> provides the list of what it proposes to do (install or remove).  It continues  automatically when the <code>-y</code> option is passed, but waits for confirmation if it does not receive the <code>-y</code>.  User error in many cases when using the <code>-y</code> option with dnf.</p>", "post_number": 12, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 15, "updated_at": "2024-04-23T00:02:50.335Z", "reply_count": 0, "reply_to_post_number": null, "quote_count": 1, "incoming_link_count": 16, "reads": 37, "readers_count": 36, "score": 102.4, "yours": false, "topic_id": 114000, "topic_slug": "unable-to-dnf-history-rollback-to-undo-remove-and-all-removed-unused-dependencies", "display_username": "Jeff V", "primary_group_name": "ask-fedora", "flair_name": "ask-fedora", "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": "", "flair_color": "", "flair_group_id": 53, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": "Q&A Leader", "title_is_group": false, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [{"id": 2, "count": 1}], "moderator": true, "admin": false, "staff": true, "user_id": 3019, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 4, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/unable-to-dnf-history-rollback-to-undo-remove-and-all-removed-unused-dependencies/114000/12", "event": null, "reactions": [{"id": "heart", "type": "emoji", "count": 1}], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 1, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": null}, {"id": 295175, "name": "Lamy Geier", "username": "lamyer", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/l/b193c8/{size}.png", "created_at": "2024-04-23T09:39:01.937Z", "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"vgaetera\" data-post=\"9\" data-topic=\"114000\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://sea1.discourse-cdn.com/fedoraproject/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/vgaetera/48/2552_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Vladislav Grigoryev:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-plaintext\">sudo dnf history undo 339\n</code></pre>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>We can see the output of the command in (<a href=\"https://0x0.st/XoCL.txt\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://0x0.st/XoCL.txt</a>) that 688 packages will be installed, but 4158 packages were removed as per</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"lamyer\" data-post=\"7\" data-topic=\"114000\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/l/b193c8/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Lamy Geier:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Please see the output at: <a href=\"https://0x0.st/Xo72.txt\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://0x0.st/Xo72.txt </a></p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>So, will this undo it to previous state or is it an incomplete operation?</p>", "post_number": 14, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 15, "updated_at": "2024-04-23T09:39:01.937Z", "reply_count": 0, "reply_to_post_number": 9, "quote_count": 2, "incoming_link_count": 7, "reads": 33, "r